nzhen exclusively owns any intellectual property rights resulting from the performance of this agreement. The service fee payable by Shenzhen Xunlei to Giganology Shenzhen is a certain percentage of its earnings. The supplemental agreement will expire in September 2035 and will be automatically renewed for a further period of ten years thereafter. Giganology Shenzhen is entitled to terminate the agreement at any time by providing 30 days’ prior written notice to Shenzhen Xunlei.","context":"Exclusive technology support and services agreement","section":"Business operation agreement","block":1122,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-050304","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-28","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001510593","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1510593/000110465926050304/xnet-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/7354e7b6c5b95c38eab98aee90d11eb575e3518801d4d8ee1a2ceead95a21a80.bin","sha256":"7354e7b6c5b95c38eab98aee90d11eb575e3518801d4d8ee1a2ceead95a21a80"}},{"id":"65b9d57c3704072df7584e5e7c82e1714f2cfefe0c493da2430b09ed5b9826a6","quote":"Exclusive technology consulting and training agreement","context":"Pursuant to the exclusive technology support and services agreement between Giganology Shenzhen and Shenzhen Xunlei, as amended, Giganology Shenzhen has the exclusive right to provide to Shenzhen Xunlei technology support and technology services related to all technologies needed for its business. Giganology Shenzhen exclusively owns any intellectual property rights resulting from the performance of this agreement. The service fee payable by Shenzhen Xunlei to Giganology Shenzhen is a certain percentage of its earnings. The supplemental agreement will expire in September 2035 and will be automatically renewed for a further period of ten years thereafter. Giganology Shenzhen is entitled to terminate the agreement at any time by providing 30 days’ prior written notice to Shenzhen Xunlei.","section":"Business operation agreement","block":1123,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-050304","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-28","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001510593","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1510593/000110465926050304/xnet-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/7354e7b6c5b95c38eab98aee90d11eb575e3518801d4d8ee1a2ceead95a21a80.bin","sha256":"7354e7b6c5b95c38eab98aee90d11eb575e3518801d4d8ee1a2ceead95a21a80"}},{"id":"c5cf388d2bd0092045839afe8513913b9e79a632fe3776a7b510c5b90ab1578d","quote":"Pursuant to the exclusive technology consulting and training agreement between Giganology Shenzhen and Shenzhen Xunlei, as amended, Giganology Shenzhen has the exclusive right to provide to Shenzhen Xunlei technology consulting and training services related to its business. Giganology Shenzhen exclusively owns any intellectual property rights resulting from the performance of this agreement. The service fee payable by Shenzhen Xunlei to Giganology Shenzhen is a certain percentage of its earnings. The supplemental agreement will expire in September 2035 and will be automatically renewed for a further period of ten years thereafter. Giganology Shenzhen is entitled to terminate the agreement at any time by providing 30 days’ prior written notice to Shenzhen Xunlei.","context":"Exclusive technology consulting and training agreement","section":"Business operation agreement","block":1124,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-050304","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-28","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001510593","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1510593/000110465926050304/xnet-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/7354e7b6c5b95c38eab98aee90d11eb575e3518801d4d8ee1a2ceead95a21a80.bin",